    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Triggered by approval, never by a clock\nThis workflow has no schedule.\nIt only runs when workflow 1 hands it an approved trip - which means the\nhuman gate cannot be bypassed by editing a Code node.\n\nThe manual trigger + **Test payload** let you exercise the whole thing\nwithout waiting for a real swell.",
        "height": 320,
        "width": 480,
        "color": 4
